## Abstract

A probabilistic weather forecast is critical for decision-making, from the everyday to preparation for extreme events. Forecasts of the joint distribution of weather trajectories via spatio-temporally coherent ensembles have further importance: they provide a powerful tool for decision-making in complex and high-impact domains including energy system planning, transportation
